    text: "Affected stops:\r\nMontview Blvd & Peoria St (#26407) (eastbound)\r\nQuentin St & 19th Pl (#26408) (eastbound)\r\nQuentin St & 17th Pl (#26409) (eastbound)\r\nQuentin St & 17th Pl (#26410) (westbound)\r\nQuentin St & 19th Pl (#26411) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\nMontview Blvd & Nome St (#15591)\r\n16th Ave & Quentin St (#34196)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\nQuentin St & 16th Ave (#33075)\r\nMontview Blvd & Nome St (#15592)"
